{"version":1,"content":"<p>烏克蘭周四（15日）恢復襲擊俄羅斯一間煉油廠。</p><p>烏克蘭總統澤連斯基表示，基輔放棄美國總統特朗普公布涵蓋能源設施的停火安排，並批評特朗普願意與莫斯科達成協議。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T03:39:35.065242+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":78,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T03:19:43+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T05:37:39.061675+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T03:37:37.438048+00:00","content_hash":"a9f54195f3e148fb90c5aebf9ac7513b2a2edd7d9054094c2c3c6be75671c965","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}